	"version": "0.2.3",
	"mcpName": "ai.slidingbox/hydrate-dehydrate",
	"description": "MCP server for Slidingbox: hand a secret from one agent to another as an encrypted, pay-per-read, delivered-once pointer, and pre-flight an x402 endpoint before paying it. Local stdio by design \u2014 it encrypts in your own process, so there is no hosted version to hand your plaintext to.",
